1
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:32,990
(Recap)
Hi.

2
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,720
Hi.

3
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,490
Five guys and one girl.

4
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,860
The most popular guy

5
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,540
is Cao Yiheng.

6
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:41,420
Any expectations

7
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,340
for who you'll fall for?

8
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,100
I kind of like

9
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,140
someone emotionally stable.

10
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:46,940
(Smiles)
Pretty stable.

11
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:47,580
She means him.

12
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:48,540
What about you?

13
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,020
Someone who looks clean-cut.

14
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,220
Any other keywords?

15
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,380
Any personality traits you're drawn to?

16
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,100
(Purses lips)

17
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,100
Two extroverts

18
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,100
(Jumps in to help)
piling on one introvert.

19
00:00:57,260 --> 00:00:58,500
Nice save.

20
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,340
Can you tell?

21
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:00,100
Today's...

22
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,580
(Instant answer)
color.

23
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:05,060
So the introvert is Yue'er?

24
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,220
Why do I feel like

25
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:06,700
she's pretty outgoing.

26
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,340
She's surrounded by guys.

27
00:01:08,340 --> 00:01:09,140
If it were me,

28
00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:10,100
I'd be introverted too.

29
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:11,460
Right.

30
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:13,580
Everyone's staring at Yue'er.

31
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:17,620
Time to reveal everyone's info.

32
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:18,180
I'll go first.

33
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:19,460
Check it out.

34
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:22,980
Here it comes.

35
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:25,820
Hewen's impressive too.

36
00:01:26,220 --> 00:01:27,380
The guy you admire most,

37
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:28,540
switch seats with him.

38
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:31,900
This episode's "firepower" is intense.

39
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:34,620
Yue'er is completely surrounded.

40
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,060
We should learn from her.

41
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:37,180
She's so upfront about it.

42
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:38,540
Hi.

43
00:01:39,540 --> 00:01:40,700
Welcome, come on in.

44
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:41,700
Where's your suitcase?

45
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:43,180
It's downstairs.

46
00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:44,740
(Reaches out)
What's the fight?

47
00:01:44,860 --> 00:01:45,220
One end each.

48
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,060
I've got the front.

49
00:01:46,060 --> 00:01:46,940
(Fumbles it again)
Okay.

50
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:48,100
(Catches it)

51
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:50,100
Mind if I go take a look at the house?

52
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:51,420
I haven't seen it either.

53
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,860
No shame at all.

54
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:54,260
Perfect timing.

55
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:55,340
Three tour guides

56
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:56,380
and one tourist.

57
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,820
They're really sticking close.

58
00:01:59,820 --> 00:02:01,620
Like real estate agents showing a place.

59
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:02,580
All eyes on Yue'er.

60
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,400
♪Don't stay trapped inside your room♪

61
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,800
♪Outside the window, the rain has cleared♪

62
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,080
♪Set reality aside♪

63
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,400
♪Follow your heart♪

64
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,760
♪What you've been longing for is right ahead♪

65
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,240
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

66
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:17,120
♪Just be a little braver♪

67
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,880
♪Come closer, come closer♪

68
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:22,960
♪There's a little spark shining in your eyes♪

69
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,080
♪That's the signal of a heart coming alive♪

70
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,800
♪That's the signal of a heart coming alive♪

71
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:32,900
=Heart Signal (China Version) S9=

72
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:35,940
Day two.

73
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:40,220
Off work.

74
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:42,220
They're heading back to the house.

75
00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:44,700
So many bags.

76
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:51,180
What are you two making?

77
00:02:51,180 --> 00:02:53,460
Beef with tomato and egg.

78
00:02:53,460 --> 00:02:55,180
He's doing beef with cilantro.

79
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:57,780
What are you making?

80
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:59,060
I want to make fish.

81
00:02:59,340 --> 00:03:00,140
Fish?

82
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:01,060
Fish is tough.

83
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:01,980
I love fish.

84
00:03:01,980 --> 00:03:02,820
Perfect.

85
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:05,420
Let me go get the ingredients ready.

86
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:08,700
Just simple home cooking.

87
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:12,860
I brought some fruit for everyone.

88
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:13,460
We can all have some.

89
00:03:15,660 --> 00:03:16,980
(Feeds her)
Try some watermelon.

90
00:03:17,060 --> 00:03:17,620
I'll hold it.

91
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:18,100
Sure.

92
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:19,380
They're nice.

93
00:03:19,740 --> 00:03:21,260
You can have some watermelon first.

94
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:22,140
(Fed again)
Thanks.

95
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,140
No problem.

96
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:24,660
Okay.

97
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:26,780
Diced tomato stir-fry.

98
00:03:30,260 --> 00:03:31,060
You even have a cheat sheet.

99
00:03:32,220 --> 00:03:34,180
(Recipe cheat sheet)

100
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:41,660
I'm going to fry it.

101
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,060
You mean deep-fry it?

102
00:03:43,060 --> 00:03:43,700
Right.

103
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:44,820
This fish needs to be fried.

104
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:47,220
I brought this from home.

105
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:48,820
A ladle.

106
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:50,500
What's this?

107
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:52,700
This?

108
00:03:56,060 --> 00:03:57,540
(Puts on gloves)

109
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:03,420
(Puts on a hat)

110
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:04,940
(Fully geared up)

111
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:07,060
What's that?

112
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:08,660
A protective mask.

113
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:10,580
So the oil doesn't

114
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:11,620
splatter on her face while frying.

115
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:13,420
(Added to the wish list)

116
00:04:13,460 --> 00:04:14,380
You can tell right away

117
00:04:14,380 --> 00:04:15,420
she loves shopping online

118
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:16,460
(Online-shopping expert)
for little gadgets.

119
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:16,900
Right.

120
00:04:23,580 --> 00:04:25,380
The beekeeper has arrived.

121
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:32,660
(Watching closely)

122
00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:34,900
(Moves closer)

123
00:04:35,140 --> 00:04:36,820
(Pours the oil)

124
00:04:37,780 --> 00:04:38,860
(Tests the temperature)

125
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:39,940
So professional.

126
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:42,140
(Puts gloves on)

127
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:43,940
Careful.

128
00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:44,740
(Steps back)

129
00:04:44,740 --> 00:04:45,700
(Steps forward)
Step back a little.

130
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:46,780
(Steps back)

131
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:49,020
(Sears it first)

132
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:52,500
This fish smells amazing.

133
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:54,060
(Sizzle)

134
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:55,300
Careful.

135
00:04:55,820 --> 00:04:57,420
Slow down.

136
00:04:58,420 --> 00:04:59,140
Got it.

137
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,340
Such a useful little thing.

138
00:05:00,350 --> 00:05:02,180
(Sold on it again)
I'm hooked again.

139
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:10,180
(Prepares the fish sauce)

140
00:05:10,180 --> 00:05:10,860
Smells amazing.

141
00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:14,700
(Simmers it after)

142
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:15,620
She's definitely

143
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:16,820
made this at home before.

144
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:17,780
So skilled.

145
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:20,100
Food's ready.

146
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:22,860
First dish.

147
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:24,740
That's right.

148
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,100
(The house's very first dish, complete)

149
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:27,900
Amazing.

150
00:05:28,460 --> 00:05:29,860
We'll take a break, then.

151
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:31,660
Just admiring them

152
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:32,780
cooking together, what a sight.

153
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:36,620
He's taking a photo of that dish.

154
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:39,380
Photograph the recipe too.

155
00:05:41,580 --> 00:05:42,140
Just documenting it.

156
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:44,820
The house's first dish.

157
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:47,420
That's such a sweet smile.

158
00:05:48,380 --> 00:05:49,380
I'm so touched.

159
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:51,140
You've been documenting everything

160
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:52,300
since the moment I met you.

161
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:03,940
(Looks)

162
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:06,540
You're the only one in my lens.

163
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:09,420
That's really romantic.

164
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:10,860
Music people are just different.

165
00:06:10,860 --> 00:06:12,100
There's definitely

166
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,220
a romantic streak in him.

167
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:14,420
It's rare to see

168
00:06:14,420 --> 00:06:15,700
a guy willing to pick up a camera

169
00:06:15,700 --> 00:06:16,900
just to capture a girl.

170
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:18,140
I think that's so thoughtful.

171
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:19,100
And out of everyone,

172
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:20,220
he's only shooting you.

173
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:20,900
Right.

174
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:21,700
Treating you differently

175
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:22,940
than everyone else.

176
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,660
That's a real plus in my book.

177
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:28,620
Hi.

178
00:06:28,940 --> 00:06:30,180
Hey, everyone.

179
00:06:30,900 --> 00:06:31,540
Hi.

180
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:33,180
Hi.

181
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,980
That braised fish looks great.

182
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:36,980
All done.

183
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:40,100
I'm practically drooling.

184
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:40,820
Does the fish

185
00:06:40,820 --> 00:06:41,380
look nice?

186
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:42,220
You're so professional.

187
00:06:43,220 --> 00:06:44,220
Really well made.

188
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:45,900
A big dish.

189
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:47,380
Coming through.

190
00:06:48,420 --> 00:06:49,140
Wow.

191
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:50,220
That looks delicious already.

192
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:53,780
(The house's very first meal, complete)

193
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:55,580
Looks great.

194
00:06:55,740 --> 00:06:56,660
Let's eat.

195
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:58,340
Eat first.

196
00:06:58,340 --> 00:06:59,580
I can't wait any longer.

197
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:01,060
I'm starving.

198
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:02,420
I'm not that hungry.

199
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,620
But I can sit here and chat.

200
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:04,700
Sit down.

201
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,420
Let me have a taste first.

202
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:10,100
Is this the legendary sea bass?

203
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:11,900
So, listen.

204
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:12,900
It's just that it's

205
00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:13,900
my first time using an induction cooker,

206
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:14,660
and the skin fell apart.

207
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:15,460
It's fine. Let me try it.

208
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:17,580
I don't even know if it's good.

209
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:19,060
Is it edible?

210
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:20,420
It's good.

211
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,100
It's good.

212
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:23,100
It's good.

213
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:24,900
I think the flavor's really strong.

214
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:26,820
When the first time
I tried your cooking,

215
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:27,500
I said the same thing.

216
00:07:28,180 --> 00:07:29,420
So good, out of this world.

217
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:31,940
(Impressed again)

218
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:35,140
Have you tried the one I made?

219
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:36,340
It was a mess.

220
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:37,380
(Notices)
I'm about to try it now.

221
00:07:37,380 --> 00:07:37,900
Okay.

222
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:39,020
Why do you call it a mess?

223
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:39,900
Because I put the eggs

224
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:40,620
in the wrong order.

225
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:42,500
It's fine.

226
00:07:42,740 --> 00:07:43,500
Really good.

227
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:44,140
(Compliments him)

228
00:07:44,380 --> 00:07:45,260
Really good.

229
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:46,740
(Laughs)

230
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:47,700
I'm so happy.

231
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:49,060
Dinner's ready the second I get home.

232
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:57,220
Zhao Xilun.

233
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:58,740
(Zhao Xilun's back)
Just got off work.

234
00:07:58,740 --> 00:07:59,980
Zhao Xilun's back.

235
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:01,340
What did he buy?

236
00:08:02,340 --> 00:08:03,420
Hi, everyone.

237
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:04,660
Everyone's here.

238
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:06,020
Hi.

239
00:08:06,180 --> 00:08:07,380
Hi.

240
00:08:08,980 --> 00:08:09,780
Sorry.

241
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:10,620
Bit of traffic.

242
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:11,620
Have you eaten?

243
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:12,980
Not yet.

244
00:08:12,980 --> 00:08:13,540
He bought groceries.

245
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:15,060
Have some.

246
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:16,540
Eat something.

247
00:08:16,540 --> 00:08:16,860
Sure.

248
00:08:16,860 --> 00:08:17,700
Eat something.

249
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:19,620
You even bought some
vegetables and stuff?

250
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,420
I'm making everyone

251
00:08:21,420 --> 00:08:23,100
an anti-inflammatory juice tomorrow.

252
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:25,020
(Attentive)

253
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:26,700
I feel so guilty.

254
00:08:26,700 --> 00:08:28,140
Let me wash these bowls.

255
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:29,700
Why are you so late today?

256
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:30,740
Today I had

257
00:08:30,740 --> 00:08:31,900
traffic,

258
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:34,140
plus some random little
things of my own.

259
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:35,380
It's clean.

260
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:35,940
This one.

261
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:39,180
Why don't you eat something first?

262
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:40,100
(Caring)

263
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:41,500
I'll eat after I wash up.

264
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:41,900
Right.

265
00:08:41,900 --> 00:08:43,180
I'd feel a little guilty otherwise.

266
00:08:43,180 --> 00:08:44,060
Let me wash it.

267
00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:44,700
Eat after
washing the dish?

268
00:08:44,700 --> 00:08:46,300
Won't you have to wash that bowl too?

269
00:08:47,060 --> 00:08:48,460
If I don't wash up,
I can't enjoy the food.

270
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:50,540
(Gets up)

271
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:51,820
Sun Qimeng's paying him some attention.

272
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,260
(Notices)

273
00:08:58,780 --> 00:08:59,580
I'll wash.

274
00:08:59,580 --> 00:09:00,300
Go eat something.

275
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:00,820
Okay.

276
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:02,180
I'm really going to eat now.

277
00:09:02,180 --> 00:09:03,300
Wash dishes together.

278
00:09:03,300 --> 00:09:03,780
Helping him out.

279
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:04,660
I'm here.

280
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:06,020
I've got that...

281
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:07,140
(Jumps in to help)
I'm taking over.

282
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:08,940
Their outfits match well today too.

283
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,700
Thanks, these are surgical gloves.

284
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:11,580
The blue ones.

285
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:13,620
Sun Qimeng seems different today.

286
00:09:13,620 --> 00:09:15,940
You have to put them on like this.

287
00:09:16,540 --> 00:09:17,260
Doesn't matter how you take them off.

288
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:18,500
But to put them on,
it has to be sterile.

289
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:18,980
Thanks.

290
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:21,580
You really know these stuffs.

291
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:23,100
Are you really a math major?

292
00:09:24,220 --> 00:09:24,900
Well.

293
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:28,740
I'll wipe it for you.

294
