Right, she's from Tianjin too.

587
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:50,180
(Nods)
He's from Tianjin too.

588
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:52,180
He's asking if Tianjin's too crowded.

589
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:54,500
Maybe he wants it to just be
the two of them.

590
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:54,780
Right.

591
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:55,300
Honestly I think

592
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:56,380
(Total blabbermouth)
he let it slip a little.

593
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:57,820
In his head, he'd

594
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:58,660
already thought

595
00:18:58,660 --> 00:18:59,580
about taking her...

596
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:00,060
Right.

597
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:00,780
Back to Tianjin.

598
00:19:00,780 --> 00:19:01,500
Right.

599
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:02,100
That's why it

600
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:03,220
slipped out just now.

601
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:03,980
Blurted right out.

602
00:19:03,980 --> 00:19:04,820
Everyone else, huh.

603
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:05,980
What are you talking about?

604
00:19:11,300 --> 00:19:12,540
(Exchange a knowing smile)

605
00:19:14,220 --> 00:19:15,180
I want some water.

606
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:18,060
Do you two want some water?

607
00:19:18,060 --> 00:19:19,540
(Shoots a look)

608
00:19:20,220 --> 00:19:21,180
Sure.

609
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:22,940
Should we go get some water?

610
00:19:23,100 --> 00:19:24,260
(Pulls)

611
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:26,500
Let's grab water.

612
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:27,540
Okay.

613
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:29,420
Let's grab water.

614
00:19:29,420 --> 00:19:30,220
Grab water.

615
00:19:30,660 --> 00:19:31,580
Wanted some water.

616
00:19:31,580 --> 00:19:34,140
Got it.

617
00:19:34,140 --> 00:19:35,420
Everyone got the message.

618
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:38,820
Pretty cute.

619
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:40,660
(Excited)

620
00:19:41,460 --> 00:19:43,260
I think Xilun's the type

621
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:44,580
who watches you two

622
00:19:44,580 --> 00:19:45,340
just for the fun of it.

623
00:19:45,340 --> 00:19:47,420
I really enjoy
watching stuff like this.

624
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:49,060
And he's the one nudging

625
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:50,820
(The vibe smoother)
them closer

626
00:19:50,820 --> 00:19:51,460
together

627
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:52,420
through moves like that.

628
00:19:59,620 --> 00:20:00,980
Why'd everyone leave?

629
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:02,340
We're grabbing water.

630
00:20:02,340 --> 00:20:03,580
Okay.

631
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:04,900
Then we'll wait for you.

632
00:20:09,020 --> 00:20:10,820
I think everyone
can sense

633
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:12,220
that these two
want to be here alone.

634
00:20:12,220 --> 00:20:13,300
So they'll step aside.

635
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:14,260
(Walks into the study)

636
00:20:14,260 --> 00:20:15,900
Everyone's doing well.

637
00:20:23,860 --> 00:20:24,860
(Glances over)

638
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:25,860
But sometimes

639
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:26,900
people who seem carefree

640
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:28,100
get flustered

641
00:20:28,100 --> 00:20:29,500
when they actually
face this kind of thing.

642
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:30,380
They will.

643
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:32,940
What do you find
special about Tianjin?

644
00:20:33,500 --> 00:20:35,380
Nothing really special.

645
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:36,140
It's normal.

646
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:37,060
I just have

647
00:20:37,060 --> 00:20:38,780
this one rooftop I go to.

648
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:40,660
A rooftop?

649
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:41,940
What do you do up there?

650
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:43,180
Watch the sunrise
and sunset.

651
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:43,900
You like the sunrise
and sunset?

652
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:44,900
Just take in the view.

653
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:45,860
Take in the view.

654
00:21:00,780 --> 00:21:02,100
Turned the corner
and left.

655
00:21:02,100 --> 00:21:02,860
We do the same thing
back in the house.

656
00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:04,180
(Deliberately steps back)
Spot them and back off.

657
00:21:04,860 --> 00:21:05,620
So in sync.

658
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:08,740
(Looks back)

659
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:17,700
What's wrong?

660
00:21:22,460 --> 00:21:25,930
Be a little braver.

661
00:21:25,940 --> 00:21:27,180
Psyching herself up.

662
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:28,620
She feels like she's
not brave enough.

663
00:21:29,820 --> 00:21:31,340
I need to take initiative.

664
00:21:31,340 --> 00:21:32,700
Take the lead.

665
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:35,340
I need to try harder.

666
00:21:38,500 --> 00:21:40,620
So adorable.

667
00:21:41,180 --> 00:21:41,940
Buck up,

668
00:21:41,940 --> 00:21:42,620
Meng.

669
00:21:42,620 --> 00:21:43,820
Go for it.

670
00:21:43,820 --> 00:21:44,900
Xilun,

671
00:21:44,900 --> 00:21:46,900
want to go for a walk together?

672
00:21:47,300 --> 00:21:49,820
Meng is interested in Xilun.

673
00:21:50,580 --> 00:21:52,500
Hi.

674
00:21:54,180 --> 00:21:55,180
(Getting water)
Hi.

675
00:21:55,180 --> 00:21:56,220
Here's her chance.

676
00:21:56,580 --> 00:21:58,820
We gave them some space alone.

677
00:21:58,820 --> 00:21:59,820
That's nice.

678
00:21:59,820 --> 00:22:01,260
(Turns to look)

679
00:22:01,270 --> 00:22:02,100
Come on, go for it.

680
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:02,980
(Turns to look)
Say it.

681
00:22:02,980 --> 00:22:04,580
Buck up.

682
00:22:09,540 --> 00:22:10,620
Look at that.

683
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:12,660
She got called away.

684
00:22:12,660 --> 00:22:14,140
(Water fetched, then called away)

685
00:22:15,500 --> 00:22:16,980
(Downstairs)
Want to come down?

686
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:18,740
She's pointing them out

687
00:22:18,740 --> 00:22:19,580
to her

688
00:22:19,580 --> 00:22:20,740
those two downstairs.

689
00:22:20,740 --> 00:22:21,740
(Watches)

690
00:22:22,340 --> 00:22:23,540
(Heads downstairs)

691
00:22:23,620 --> 00:22:24,260
(Heads downstairs)

692
00:22:24,260 --> 00:22:26,380
Xilun, wait...

693
00:22:29,620 --> 00:22:31,540
When you like someone,
you get all sneaky.

694
00:22:31,980 --> 00:22:33,220
(Moves closer)
Following them around.

695
00:22:35,540 --> 00:22:37,620
(Flustered)
Go on, say it.

696
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:40,700
(Zhao Xilun
heading downstairs)

697
00:22:40,700 --> 00:22:42,340
Follow him, say it.

698
00:22:42,780 --> 00:22:44,100
(Catches up)
Should we go down?

699
00:22:44,100 --> 00:22:45,500
Not sure.

700
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:50,580
(Scratches head)

701
00:22:54,180 --> 00:22:54,860
Sit closer.

702
00:22:54,860 --> 00:22:56,300
(Scoots over)
It's cold over there.

703
00:22:56,300 --> 00:22:58,420
Why are you sitting so close to him?

704
00:23:00,980 --> 00:23:01,950
Are you cold?

705
00:23:06,420 --> 00:23:08,620
(Sits down next to Cui Kaiyi)

706
00:23:09,460 --> 00:23:10,620
Playing wingman now.

707
00:23:11,580 --> 00:23:12,820
(Exchange a knowing smile)

708
00:23:12,860 --> 00:23:14,100
He's hilarious.

709
00:23:14,420 --> 00:23:14,980
Sometimes,

710
00:23:14,980 --> 00:23:16,620
both guys and girls

711
00:23:16,620 --> 00:23:18,340
have their own "relationship advisors".

712
00:23:19,020 --> 00:23:20,200
Come down.

713
00:23:20,210 --> 00:23:21,010
(Look down)
Sure.

714
00:23:21,020 --> 00:23:22,200
Let's go check.

715
00:23:22,460 --> 00:23:23,220
We lost them.

716
00:23:23,220 --> 00:23:24,340
We really lost them.

717
00:23:24,340 --> 00:23:25,340
What now?

718
00:23:25,740 --> 00:23:26,940
It's okay. Don't worry.

719
00:23:29,220 --> 00:23:31,620
Come sit with us.

720
00:23:31,620 --> 00:23:32,900
(Inviting them over)

721
00:23:32,900 --> 00:23:34,780
We were just talking about
the stargazing room

722
00:23:34,780 --> 00:23:35,700
and the city date.

723
00:23:35,700 --> 00:23:36,820
Which one would you choose?

724
00:23:38,620 --> 00:23:39,980
I think they're both great.

725
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:40,940
Yeah.

726
00:23:40,940 --> 00:23:42,900
You just get to know
each other differently.

727
00:23:43,180 --> 00:23:44,700
Either one's a good choice.

728
00:23:44,700 --> 00:23:46,180
Exactly.

729
00:23:53,940 --> 00:23:57,380
Meng missed his chance earlier.

730
00:23:57,380 --> 00:23:58,620
Now there are five people.

731
00:23:59,300 --> 00:24:00,100
As someone

732
00:24:00,100 --> 00:24:02,140
who's lived in the house,

733
00:24:02,140 --> 00:24:03,780
I'd like to speak for the girls.

734
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:04,700
(Speaking from experience)
Sometimes,

735
00:24:05,020 --> 00:24:06,700
I'm pretty introverted.

736
00:24:06,700 --> 00:24:07,820
I wouldn't dare

737
00:24:08,340 --> 00:24:10,100
say what I wanted to do

738
00:24:10,420 --> 00:24:11,700
in a group setting.

739
00:24:11,700 --> 00:24:12,540
But

740
00:24:12,540 --> 00:24:13,260
the group

741
00:24:13,260 --> 00:24:14,300
is always changing.

742
00:24:14,300 --> 00:24:16,660
The dynamic shifts

743
00:24:16,660 --> 00:24:17,780
with the people

744
00:24:17,780 --> 00:24:18,900
who take the lead.

745
00:24:18,900 --> 00:24:20,020
If I were

746
00:24:20,020 --> 00:24:21,180
more outgoing,

747
00:24:21,180 --> 00:24:23,020
I'd say, "Let's play pool."

748
00:24:23,340 --> 00:24:25,740
That would've changed the whole dynamic.

749
00:24:25,740 --> 00:24:26,420
Still,

750
00:24:26,420 --> 00:24:27,220
it gave us

751
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:28,260
a more genuine

752
00:24:28,260 --> 00:24:29,700
(A more genuine perspective)
view of how things felt in the house.

753
00:24:30,100 --> 00:24:30,500
Yeah.

754
00:24:31,340 --> 00:24:32,180
So,

755
00:24:32,180 --> 00:24:33,900
which district do you live in?

756
00:24:34,500 --> 00:24:35,580
I forgot again.

757
00:24:35,940 --> 00:24:37,300
I've probably asked a dozen times.

758
00:24:37,460 --> 00:24:38,540
I'm in Xicheng District.

759
00:24:38,540 --> 00:24:39,900
(Volunteers an answer)

760
00:24:40,050 --> 00:24:40,960
That's pretty far.

761
00:24:42,860 --> 00:24:43,700
That must be rough.

762
00:24:46,420 --> 00:24:47,820
Oh, you're all here.

763
00:24:50,020 --> 00:24:50,740
Where've you been?

764
00:24:50,740 --> 00:24:51,780
We've been chatting outside

765
00:24:51,780 --> 00:24:52,340
for a while.

766
00:24:52,900 --> 00:24:54,220
What about you guys?

767
00:24:54,580 --> 00:24:55,940
Just chatting.

768
00:24:56,820 --> 00:24:59,140
What were you talking about?

769
00:24:59,420 --> 00:25:00,180
We just started.

770
00:25:00,180 --> 00:25:01,300
Want to join us?

771
00:25:02,660 --> 00:25:04,580
Just random stuff.

772
00:25:06,860 --> 00:25:09,300
We were talking about

773
00:25:09,500 --> 00:25:10,100
where we'd go

774
00:25:10,100 --> 00:25:11,580
for the city date.

775
00:25:14,140 --> 00:25:16,180
It's a bit chilly.

776
00:25:16,180 --> 00:25:17,340
Can we turn it up?

777
00:25:17,340 --> 00:25:18,060
The remote's over there.

778
00:25:18,060 --> 00:25:19,420
Isn't it over there?

779
00:25:20,260 --> 00:25:21,780
(Gets up to help)
Turn it up a bit.

780
00:25:21,940 --> 00:25:22,900
I will go turn it off.

781
00:25:23,860 --> 00:25:24,810
Want to join us?

782
00:25:24,820 --> 00:25:25,920
Sure.

783
00:25:26,700 --> 00:25:27,700
He walked off.

784
00:25:30,500 --> 00:25:32,780
Kaiyi seems to like Bohan.

785
00:25:32,780 --> 00:25:33,940
(Cui Kaiyi, Sun Bohan)
She definitely likes him.

786
00:25:33,940 --> 00:25:35,220
Yeah, Kaiyi

787
00:25:35,220 --> 00:25:35,700
is into Bohan.

788
00:25:35,700 --> 00:25:36,620
You can tell she likes Bohan.

789
00:25:36,620 --> 00:25:38,100
(Cui Kaiyi, Sun Bohan)
She checked out his profile

790
00:25:38,100 --> 00:25:38,860
at the dinner.

791
00:25:48,500 --> 00:25:49,420
Are you reading?

792
00:25:49,420 --> 00:25:50,300
Yeah.

793
00:25:50,300 --> 00:25:51,140
Look, here he comes.

794
00:25:51,140 --> 00:25:52,100
What are you reading?

795
00:25:52,100 --> 00:25:53,660
"Stories about Ming Dynasty".

796
00:25:53,660 --> 00:25:54,740
"Stories about Ming Dynasty"?

797
00:25:54,740 --> 00:25:55,700
Yeah, that's quite a collection here.

798
00:25:55,700 --> 00:25:56,140
I...

799
00:25:56,580 --> 00:25:58,140
finished it at the end of last year.

800
00:25:58,140 --> 00:26:00,580
In the last volume,

801
00:26:00,580 --> 00:26:01,900
the author said,

802
00:26:01,900 --> 00:26:03,060
what makes

803
00:26:03,060 --> 00:26:04,500
a truly successful life?

804
00:26:04,500 --> 00:26:06,580
Living life

805
00:26:06,580 --> 00:26:07,380
the way you want

806
00:26:07,380 --> 00:26:08,220
is the real success.

807
00:26:08,220 --> 00:26:09,460
You've read so much.

808
00:26:10,140 --> 00:26:11,260
I mostly read history.

809
00:26:11,260 --> 00:26:12,380
Look.

810
00:26:12,660 --> 00:26:13,540
You like history too?

811
00:26:13,540 --> 00:26:14,420
Yeah, true success

812
00:26:14,420 --> 00:26:17,180
is living life your own way.

813
00:26:17,180 --> 00:26:18,220
Wow,

814
00:26:18,220 --> 00:26:19,140
you really read a lot.

815
00:26:19,140 --> 00:26:20,620
Yeah, I also like history

816
00:26:20,620 --> 00:26:22,060
and philosophy.

817
00:26:24,620 --> 00:26:25,300
Anything else?

818
00:26:25,300 --> 00:26:26,820
What else do you...?

819
00:26:26,820 --> 00:26:27,460
The rest, you'll...

820
00:26:27,460 --> 00:26:28,740
you'll learn in time.

821
00:26:32,380 --> 00:26:33,740
Wow.

822
00:26:33,740 --> 00:26:34,660
Not bad.

823
00:26:35,340 --> 00:26:36,780
What do you usually read?

824
00:26:37,740 --> 00:26:38,700
I...

825
00:26:38,700 --> 00:26:39,620
Books?

826
00:26:41,340 --> 00:26:41,980
Biography.

827
00:26:41,980 --> 00:26:42,460
"The Red and the Black".

828
00:26:42,460 --> 00:26:43,540
Have you read "The Red and the Black"?

829
00:26:43,540 --> 00:26:44,180
No.

830
00:26:44,180 --> 00:26:45,060
This...

831
00:26:45,060 --> 00:26:46,300
I've read "Zero to One".

832
00:26:47,020 --> 00:26:47,860
Careful.

833
00:26:48,980 --> 00:26:49,860
Careful.

834
00:26:50,020 --> 00:26:51,380
(Turns around)

835
00:26:51,380 --> 00:26:52,780
Drawing attention.

836
00:26:53,180 --> 00:26:54,340
Go check it out.

837
00:26:54,540 --> 00:26:56,740
The guys picked up on something.

838
00:26:56,740 --> 00:26:57,740
They'll head over soon.

839
00:26:57,740 --> 00:26:59,140
Yeah, they noticed.

840
00:26:59,900 --> 00:27:00,860
(Gets up too)

841
00:27:00,860 --> 00:27:01,340
What?

842
00:27:04,860 --> 00:27:06,460
What's going on?

843
00:27:15,660 --> 00:27:16,460
Everyone's over there.

844
00:27:17,820 --> 00:27:18,700
What's going on?

845
00:27:25,100 --> 00:27:25,980
You were reading?

846
00:27:27,060 --> 00:27:27,500
Here they come.

847
00:27:27,500 --> 00:27:28,360
(Looks up)

848
00:27:28,360 --> 00:27:29,010
There are books here.

849
00:27:29,100 --> 00:27:30,100
Here comes the competition.

850
00:27:30,670 --> 00:27:31,790
There's even
"Stories about Ming Dynasty".

851
00:27:32,380 --> 00:27:33,860
(Watching)

852
00:27:35,420 --> 00:27:36,900
It was just the two of them.

853
00:27:37,190 --> 00:27:38,260
I was just reading this,

854
00:27:38,260 --> 00:27:40,060
then he told me he'd read all seven...

855
00:27:40,060 --> 00:27:41,820
nine volumes.

856
00:27:42,740 --> 00:27:44,460
What a scene.

857
00:27:44,460 --> 00:27:45,620
The whole house is here.

858
00:27:47,020 --> 00:27:47,500
What's this?

859
00:27:47,500 --> 00:27:48,460
"The Red and the Black"?

860
00:27:48,460 --> 00:27:50,620
Yeah, it's "The Red and the Black".

861
00:27:51,820 --> 00:27:54,140
(Puts the book down)

862
00:27:54,500 --> 00:27:56,220
Do you all like reading?

863
00:27:56,220 --> 00:27:57,940
She said she loved reading on day one.

864
00:27:59,540 --> 00:28:00,540
You asked me yesterday,

865
00:28:00,540 --> 00:28:01,620
and you shot me down.

866
00:28:01,620 --> 00:28:02,340
No, I...

867
00:28:02,340 --> 00:28:02,700
Yeah.

868
00:28:02,700 --> 00:28:04,020
I owe you an apology.

869
00:28:04,020 --> 00:28:05,420
I was being narrow-minded.

870
00:28:05,420 --> 00:28:06,060
(Walks away)
I went home and...

871
00:28:06,060 --> 00:28:06,820
No, I was narrow-minded.

872
00:28:06,820 --> 00:28:08,220
I actually looked it up,

873
00:28:08,220 --> 00:28:09,140
and you were right.

874
00:28:09,140 --> 00:28:10,060
I was too narrow-minded.

875
00:28:10,060 --> 00:28:10,940
No.

876
00:28:10,940 --> 00:28:12,020
No, seriously.

877
00:28:12,020 --> 00:28:13,540
(Looks left)
Everyone sees it differently.

878
